      <w>2020</w>
      <h>80</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Blocked, foreign, stale, altered or discarded previews cannot be approved. Tool calls are schema-checked and repeat/failure limits apply.
Open gaps: F09 availability can exceed the confirmed F03 interval. Carried windows can bypass fresh timing checks.
F10 verifies that the F06 profile was reviewed, with less consistency checking than the F07 usableProfile() path.
